      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. so when you're looking at the actual people involved, how do researchers usually describe the difference between the people moving in and the people who were already living there? like, what are the different \"profiles\" of these groups in terms of their lifestyle or how they contribute to the neighborhood's vibe?",
